1413
01:22:06,046 --> 01:22:07,547
entrégocha.

1414
01:22:30,695 --> 01:22:33,323
Así soa isto!

1415
01:22:38,453 --> 01:22:40,747
Así soa isto!

1416
01:22:44,960 --> 01:22:46,336
Es o meu tipo! Ben.

1417
01:22:46,419 --> 01:22:48,296
Así soa isto!

1418
01:22:50,340 --> 01:22:52,050
Acabáronse os abdominais!

1419
