- Iso vós.

1462
01:25:36,381 --> 01:25:37,507
O REGRESO

1463
01:27:38,127 --> 01:27:41,881
Da ilusión ti es o mestre.

1464
01:27:41,965 --> 01:27:43,800
Nah-rul-sok-ee-ryuh-ha-ji-ma

1465
